# PICS values to be used when running the `system_tests` executable
#
# Only the utility/system clusters are declared here, plus the general TLV serde and IM layer
# behaviours -- which is all the `system` suite exercises. The app-cluster blocks that used to
# sit here were removed: the suite runs no test that gates on them, and `system_tests` serves
# none of those clusters.
#
# Derived and checked with `cargo xtask pics --baseline <this file> [--fix]`; see
# `docs/pics-generation-design.md`. Re-run it after changing the device's data model.

